<section class="sec"><div class="panel"><h2>About Lexal Tech Store</h2>
<p>A basic e-commerce demo built with <b>HTML, CSS, JavaScript</b> + <b>Express.js (Node.js)</b> + <b>MySQL</b>.</p>
<ul><li>🛍️ Product listings with search & category filter</li><li>🔍 Product details page with ratings, colors, reviews</li><li>🛒 Shopping cart (localStorage + promo codes)</li><li>📦 Order processing with shipping types</li><li>👤 User registration / login (scrypt-hashed passwords + sessions)</li><li>🗄️ MySQL tables: users, products, orders, order_items</li></ul>
<p>UI combines the Lexal Tech Store desktop template (hero, trending, ideas, deals) with the mobile flows (details, cart, wishlist, checkout, order rating).</p>
